IELTS.lesson({"test": 2, "part": 1, "title": "Test 2, Part 1 — the interview", "candidate": "hadi", "script": [{"who": "examiner", "text": "Good morning. Come in, have a seat.", "ar": "صباح الخير. تفضّل بالدخول واجلس.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/1b2def3fa2b0b362.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "My name is Mohamad Khorbatli. Can you tell me your full name, please?", "ar": "اسمي محمد خرباطلي. هل يمكنك أن تخبرني باسمك الكامل من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/c756d0707f344069.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Hadi Mansour.", "ar": "هادي منصور.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/ceaffd822a91ae16.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "And what can I call you?", "ar": "وبماذا أناديك؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5085ae49113e09cf.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Hadi is fine.", "ar": "هادي يكفي.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/5712e414c47baa37.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you, Hadi. Can I see your identification, please?", "ar": "شكراً لك يا هادي. هل يمكنني رؤية هويتك من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/766d885dd8bfeba2.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Of course. Here you are.", "ar": "بالتأكيد. تفضّل.", "shot": null, "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/9db6bd4d7b1e7b70.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That's all fine.", "ar": "شكراً. كل شيء على ما يرام.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a65ff8d3eccec277.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Now, in this first part I'd like to ask you some questions about yourself. Let's talk about work.", "ar": "الآن، في هذا القسم الأول أودّ أن أسألك بعض الأسئلة عن نفسك. لنتحدّث عن العمل.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/0feea158a885a81f.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Do you work or are you a student?", "ar": "هل تعمل أم أنت طالب؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/ea13e473201f1222.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I work. I'm a site engineer, and I'm on a residential job in Homs at the moment, six floors. It's probably eighteen months from finished if nothing goes wrong, which it will.", "ar": "أعمل. أنا مهندس موقع، وأعمل حالياً في مشروع سكني في حمص، ستة طوابق. يحتاج على الأرجح إلى ثمانية عشر شهراً حتى ينتهي إن لم يحدث خطأ، وسيحدث.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/f7ffcf8d6a5db9b6.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "What do you do on a typical day at work?", "ar": "ماذا تفعل في يوم عمل عادي؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/78a109a9bc9ad5e3.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Look, most of it is checking. I walk the floors in Homs in the morning and I check what was poured yesterday actually matches the drawing, and then I'm on the phone all afternoon to people who are late. Basically I'm paid to notice things early.", "ar": "انظر، معظمه تدقيق. أتجوّل في الطوابق في حمص صباحاً وأتحقّق من أن ما صُبّ أمس يطابق المخطّط فعلاً، ثم أكون على الهاتف بعد الظهر كلّه مع أشخاص متأخّرين. في الأساس يدفعون لي لأنني ألاحظ الأمور مبكّراً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/9270fd4161df593f.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Do you enjoy your job?", "ar": "هل تستمتع بعملك؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/c353420a8912d7c3.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Most days, yes. The part I like is that at the end of it there's a building. I mean, you can walk past it in Homs in ten years and it's still standing, and not many jobs give you that.", "ar": "في معظم الأيام، نعم. ما يعجبني أنه في النهاية يكون هناك مبنى. أعني، يمكنك أن تمرّ به في حمص بعد عشر سنوات ويكون لا يزال قائماً، وقليل من الأعمال تمنحك ذلك.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/cd6bcfeb9a257578.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Is there anything you'd change about it?", "ar": "هل هناك شيء تودّ تغييره فيه؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/0bccd630eb9cb70a.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "The waiting. You can lose three weeks in Homs because one delivery didn't arrive, and there's nothing you can do with that time. To be honest that's harder than the actual work.", "ar": "الانتظار. يمكن أن تخسر ثلاثة أسابيع في حمص لأن شحنة واحدة لم تصل، ولا يمكنك أن تفعل شيئاً بذلك الوقت. بصراحة هذا أصعب من العمل نفسه.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/d1f3afbfbfeb6faf.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Let's move on to talk about daily routine.", "ar": "لننتقل الآن للحديث عن الروتين اليومي.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/b10872bf06054cd4.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "What time do you usually get up?", "ar": "في أيّ ساعة تستيقظ عادةً؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/61055a3ea0e651d4.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Half five, quarter to six. Site starts at seven and the drive into Homs is about forty minutes if the road's clear. Honestly, I've never once needed an alarm on a working day, but I do oversleep at the weekend.", "ar": "الخامسة والنصف، السادسة إلا ربعاً. العمل في الموقع يبدأ عند السابعة والطريق إلى حمص نحو أربعين دقيقة إن كان سالكاً. بصراحة، لم أحتج يوماً إلى منبّه في يوم عمل، لكنني أنام متأخراً في نهاية الأسبوع.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/0e06c21b356905be.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Do you prefer mornings or evenings?", "ar": "هل تفضّل الصباح أم المساء؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5b9b8d1c3b64306d.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Mornings, easily. Put it this way: by six in the evening I'm no use to anyone. Everything difficult I do before eleven.", "ar": "الصباح، بلا شك. قل الأمر هكذا: عند السادسة مساءً لا أنفع أحداً. كل ما هو صعب أفعله قبل الحادية عشرة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/dee3621b5036005c.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Has your routine changed in the last few years?", "ar": "هل تغيّر روتينك في السنوات الأخيرة؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/2bf38d3094a012dc.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "It's got more regular, which I didn't expect. There was a long stretch in Homs when nothing was predictable, not even the power, and now the fact that I know what Tuesday looks like is worth something. I suppose I wouldn't have said that five years ago.", "ar": "صار أكثر انتظاماً، وهذا لم أتوقّعه. كانت هناك فترة طويلة في حمص لا شيء فيها متوقّع، ولا حتى الكهرباء، والآن كوني أعرف كيف يكون يوم الثلاثاء له قيمة. أظنّ أنني لم أكن سأقول ذلك قبل خمس سنوات.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/a5586da0a75102c4.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Do you ever change your routine at the weekend?", "ar": "هل تغيّر روتينك في نهاية الأسبوع أحياناً؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/65f4609644b5335f.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Completely. I don't set anything, I don't go near the site, and there's football on Friday afternoon with the same eight men I've played with since school. That's basically the whole plan.", "ar": "تماماً. لا أحدّد شيئاً، ولا أقترب من الموقع، وهناك كرة قدم بعد ظهر الجمعة مع الرجال الثمانية أنفسهم الذين ألعب معهم منذ المدرسة. هذه في الأساس كل الخطة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/a9b7270a062add8a.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Finally in this part, let's talk about free time.", "ar": "وأخيراً في هذا القسم، لنتحدّث عن وقت الفراغ.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a13a14ea7b51065d.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "What do you do in your free time?", "ar": "ماذا تفعل في وقت فراغك؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/eac78c54187f3675.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Football on Friday, and not much else that's organised. Look, by the time I get home it's seven and I've been on my feet since half six in the morning. Free time is mostly sitting down.", "ar": "كرة قدم يوم الجمعة، ولا شيء منظّم آخر تقريباً. انظر، حين أصل إلى المنزل تكون السابعة وأكون واقفاً على قدميّ منذ السادسة والنصف صباحاً. وقت الفراغ عندي هو الجلوس في الغالب.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/1dfb286b44a403bb.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Do you prefer to spend free time alone or with other people?", "ar": "هل تفضّل أن تمضي وقت فراغك وحدك أم مع آخرين؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/f7884f8c169f8349.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "With people, but quietly. I don't want to go anywhere. Four of us sitting in somebody's flat in Homs with the television on and nobody really watching it, that's basically my ideal evening.", "ar": "مع الناس، لكن بهدوء. لا أريد الذهاب إلى أيّ مكان. أربعة منا جالسين في شقة أحدهم في حمص والتلفاز مفتوح ولا أحد يشاهده فعلاً، هذه في الأساس أمسيتي المثالية.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/9e31ac99d91530df.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Have your hobbies changed since you were younger?", "ar": "هل تغيّرت هواياتك منذ أن كنت أصغر؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/45cb4a9edecc3d49.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I used to fix things that weren't broken. Motorbikes, mostly. I mean, I still would, but the flat in Homs is small and my wife's got views about engine parts in the kitchen, which to be fair are reasonable views.", "ar": "كنت أصلح أشياء غير معطّلة. دراجات نارية، في الغالب. أعني، ما زلت أفعل ذلك لو أمكن، لكن الشقة في حمص صغيرة ولزوجتي رأي في قطع المحرّك في المطبخ، وهو رأي معقول لأكون منصفاً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/54923fad426952bf.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Do you think people have enough free time?", "ar": "هل تعتقد أن الناس لديهم وقت فراغ كافٍ؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/b725efd6131fa0c1.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Depends on the job, mostly, I'd say. On site you get what the contract says and that's it. The men I work with in Homs don't talk about free time as a thing you have. They talk about Friday.", "ar": "يعتمد على العمل في الغالب، على ما أعتقد. في الموقع تحصل على ما يقوله العقد وهذا كل شيء. الرجال الذين أعمل معهم في حمص لا يتحدّثون عن وقت الفراغ كشيء تملكه. يتحدّثون عن الجمعة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/80fe21d1ace64b02.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That is the end of Part One.", "ar": "شكراً لك. بهذا ينتهي القسم الأول.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/50f379466faf1658.mp3"}], "boxes": [{"q": "Do you work or are you a student?", "ar": null, "topic": "Work", "model": "I work. I'm a site engineer, and I'm on a residential job in Homs at the moment, six floors. It's probably eighteen months from finished if nothing goes wrong, which it will.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "Answers in two words, then the job, then the place, then a dry turn at the end. 'Which it will' is the whole character in three words and it costs no vocabulary at all."}, {"q": "What do you do on a typical day at work?", "ar": null, "topic": "Work", "model": "Look, most of it is checking. I walk the floors in Homs in the morning and I check what was poured yesterday actually matches the drawing, and then I'm on the phone all afternoon to people who are late. Basically I'm paid to notice things early.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "A shape rather than a list: the morning, the afternoon, and then one sentence that says what the job IS. 'Look' and 'basically' are his markers and they are placed, not sprinkled."}, {"q": "Do you enjoy your job?", "ar": null, "topic": "Work", "model": "Most days, yes. The part I like is that at the end of it there's a building. I mean, you can walk past it in Homs in ten years and it's still standing, and not many jobs give you that.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "Concedes 'most days' before saying what he likes, which is more convincing than enthusiasm. The building standing in ten years is the specific, and it is the answer's whole argument."}, {"q": "Is there anything you'd change about it?", "ar": null, "topic": "Work", "model": "The waiting. You can lose three weeks in Homs because one delivery didn't arrive, and there's nothing you can do with that time. To be honest that's harder than the actual work.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "Names one thing and stays with it. The three weeks and the delivery are what make it an answer about his work rather than about frustration in general."}, {"q": "What time do you usually get up?", "ar": null, "topic": "Daily routine", "model": "Half five, quarter to six. Site starts at seven and the drive into Homs is about forty minutes if the road's clear. Honestly, I've never once needed an alarm on a working day, but I do oversleep at the weekend.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "Two times, a reason, a distance, and then one admission that softens it. 'If the road's clear' is a condition a band-7 speaker reaches for naturally."}, {"q": "Do you prefer mornings or evenings?", "ar": null, "topic": "Daily routine", "model": "Mornings, easily. Put it this way: by six in the evening I'm no use to anyone. Everything difficult I do before eleven.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "'Put it this way' is a marker that earns its place by introducing a reformulation. The last sentence is a rule he lives by."}, {"q": "Has your routine changed in the last few years?", "ar": null, "topic": "Daily routine", "model": "It's got more regular, which I didn't expect. There was a long stretch in Homs when nothing was predictable, not even the power, and now the fact that I know what Tuesday looks like is worth something. I suppose I wouldn't have said that five years ago.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "Says the change, says he did not expect it, and then says what it is worth. 'I wouldn't have said that five years ago' does the contrast without naming what it is contrasting with."}, {"q": "Do you ever change your routine at the weekend?", "ar": null, "topic": "Daily routine", "model": "Completely. I don't set anything, I don't go near the site, and there's football on Friday afternoon with the same eight men I've played with since school. That's basically the whole plan.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "A number, a duration, and a landing. 'Basically the whole plan' closes the answer so the examiner does not have to."}, {"q": "What do you do in your free time?", "ar": null, "topic": "Free time", "model": "Football on Friday, and not much else that's organised. Look, by the time I get home it's seven and I've been on my feet since half six in the morning. Free time is mostly sitting down.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "Two numbers, his marker, and an honest answer rather than an impressive one. 'Free time is mostly sitting down' is a landing."}, {"q": "Do you prefer to spend free time alone or with other people?", "ar": null, "topic": "Free time", "model": "With people, but quietly. I don't want to go anywhere. Four of us sitting in somebody's flat in Homs with the television on and nobody really watching it, that's basically my ideal evening.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "Qualifies the answer in the same breath as giving it - 'but quietly' - and then shows it rather than explaining it. The television nobody watches is the specific."}, {"q": "Have your hobbies changed since you were younger?", "ar": null, "topic": "Free time", "model": "I used to fix things that weren't broken. Motorbikes, mostly. I mean, I still would, but the flat in Homs is small and my wife's got views about engine parts in the kitchen, which to be fair are reasonable views.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "A habit in the past, a reason it stopped, and a concession to his wife. 'To be fair' is the marker, and conceding the other side is a band-7 move Part 3 will need later."}, {"q": "Do you think people have enough free time?", "ar": null, "topic": "Free time", "model": "Depends on the job, mostly, I'd say. On site you get what the contract says and that's it. The men I work with in Homs don't talk about free time as a thing you have. They talk about Friday.", "modelBand": 7.0, "why": "Refuses the general question, answers for the people he knows, and ends on one word that says everything. 'They talk about Friday' is the answer's real content."}], "voices": {"examiner": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "candidate": "piper-en_US-ryan-medium-s120"}});
